1
00:00:00,992 --> 00:00:02,322
(Amy:)and you stood at the rail

2
00:00:02,326 --> 00:00:04,556
(Amy:)Googling the symptoms
of hypothermia?

3
00:00:07,031 --> 00:00:09,701
(Sheldon:)We made one heck of a team, huh?

4
00:00:11,969 --> 00:00:14,169
(Amy:)Whose bra is this?

5
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:17,140
(Sheldon:)It's not yours?

6
00:00:18,509 --> 00:00:20,179
(Sheldon:)Oh, my.

7
00:00:20,177 --> 00:00:22,347
(Sheldon:)How embarrassing for both of us.

8
00:00:24,515 --> 00:00:25,645
(Amy:)It's Penny's.

9
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:27,450
(Sheldon:)Hey, you broke up with me.

10
00:00:27,451 --> 00:00:29,081
(Sheldon:)It is none of your business

11
00:00:29,086 --> 00:00:32,156
(Sheldon:)whose naked bosom I'm smooshing
around like pizza dough.

12
00:00:32,156 --> 00:00:33,586
(Amy:)Good-bye.

13
00:00:37,828 --> 00:00:38,928
(Scene:)Amy.

14
00:00:38,929 --> 00:00:40,359
Amy. Amy.

15
00:00:40,364 --> 00:00:43,064
(sighs)

16
00:00:43,067 --> 00:00:45,167
(Sheldon:)Hmm. Tables work, too.

17
00:00:45,169 --> 00:00:46,969
(Sheldon:)Good to know.

18
00:00:49,106 --> 00:00:52,306
(Howard:)Ooh, brownies
for girls' night!

19
00:00:52,309 --> 00:00:53,809
(Bernadette:)Hands off. I'm mad at you.

20
00:00:53,811 --> 00:00:54,911
(sighs)

21
00:00:54,912 --> 00:00:56,682
(Howard:)Look, I know it's
a lot of money,

22
00:00:56,681 --> 00:00:58,411
(Howard:)but the guy at
the store said

23
00:00:58,416 --> 00:01:01,446
(Howard:)in five to seven years,
it'll pay for itself.

